program	exclusivity_assign_rhs_borrow.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: `p` is written by this assignment while also being accessed in the right-hand side
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: exclusive access violation: `p` is written by this assignment while also being accessed in the right-hand side"
log	"  --> examples/exclusivity_assign_rhs_borrow.saw:28:6"
log	"     |"
log	" 28 |     p.x = bump(&var p)"
log	"     |      ^"
log	"   hint: the right-hand side is evaluated first, so its writes through that borrow are overwritten by this assignment. Bind the value in its own statement, or borrow a disjoint path"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
